    feat(http): flag namespaces whose directory is gone (REG-GONE-001)
    
    GET /api/namespaces now checks each registry row's directory on disk and
    stamps directoryMissing: true only on rows whose directory is absent;
    healthy rows omit the field. DELETE on a gone-directory namespace was
    already idempotent (DOGFOOD-004 removes the stale mapping) — locked by
    regression tests. Includes AGENTS.md count sync (162 suites / 1300 tests)
    and the docs paragraph for the new flag.
    
    Closeout for REG-GONE-001 in tick duckbrain-2026-09-21-08-03-26; the lane
    disable for QA-DUCKBRAIN-001 is ops-only (scheduler DB + fleet.toml, no
    repo diff).
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
